// CHECK: assumed (not measured) values: CellAspectRatio, Temperature (K)
// NOTE: CELL AREA CONTRADICTS ITSELF WITHIN THE PAPER. Sec. 2 says the
// vertical GAA select device gives a '4F2 per bit cell' footprint for
